      "id": "kp10-01-map",
      "slot": "concept",
      "kind": "flow-map",
      "title": "标量子查询：内层先算出一个值，外层再拿它比较",
      "stages": [
        {
          "label": "① 先单独执行内层子查询：只得到一个值",
          "note": "products 的 6 个价格取平均。",
          "tables": [
            {
              "columns": [
                "AVG(price)"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  44
                ]
              ],
              "sql": "SELECT AVG(price) FROM products"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "② 外层 WHERE：每一行的 price 都和这个值比较",
          "via": "把子查询当成一个普通数字 44 代入：WHERE price > 44",
          "tables": [
            {
              "columns": [
                "product_id",
                "price"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  1,
                  15
                ],
                [
